{"problem_id": "2e6461b7-3a73-4809-a105-93c2a20cfc89", "transformations": {"schema_version": 3, "revision": 5, "items": [{"at": "2026-10-01T19:34:38.336861+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "assets"}, "value": {"alt": "", "url": "/assets/57d1bd16-a44d-4a56-b4c9-1c7f0f42948f", "html": "<img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"57d1bd16-a44d-4a56-b4c9-1c7f0f42948f\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_1\" src=\"/assets/57d1bd16-a44d-4a56-b4c9-1c7f0f42948f\"/>", "kind": "ordinary_image", "asset_id": "57d1bd16-a44d-4a56-b4c9-1c7f0f42948f", "position": 0, "asset_key": "image_1", "parent_target_id": "section:condition:1"}, "operation": "rewrite", "transformation_target_id": "asset:image_1"}, {"at": "2026-10-01T19:34:38.336861+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "assets"}, "value": {"alt": "", "url": "/assets/25e214aa-aaec-446c-bb2a-25872ce19932", "html": "<img data-asset-key=\"image_2\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_2\"/>", "kind": "ordinary_image", "asset_id": "25e214aa-aaec-446c-bb2a-25872ce19932", "position": 0, "asset_key": "image_2", "parent_target_id": "section:solution:1"}, "operation": "rewrite", "transformation_target_id": "asset:image_2"}, {"at": "2026-10-02T15:53:02.955350+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "deterministic_svg"}, "value": {"html": "<p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"57d1bd16-a44d-4a56-b4c9-1c7f0f42948f\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_1\"/>На ри­сун­ке изоб­ра­же­ны гра­фик функ­ции <i>y</i>  =  <i>f</i>(<i>x</i>) и ка­са­тель­ная к нему в точке с абс­цис­сой <i>x</i><sub>0</sub>. Най­ди­те зна­че­ние про­из­вод­ной функ­ции <i>f</i>(<i>x</i>) в точке <i>x</i><sub>0</sub>.</p>", "title": "Условие", "asset_keys": ["image_1"]}, "operation": "rewrite", "transformation_target_id": "section:condition:1"}, {"at": "2026-10-02T15:53:02.955350+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "deterministic_svg"}, "value": {"html": "<p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"25e214aa-aaec-446c-bb2a-25872ce19932\" data-asset-key=\"image_2\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_2\"/></p><p>Зна­че­ние про­из­вод­ной в точке ка­са­ния равно уг­ло­во­му ко­эф­фи­ци­ен­ту ка­са­тель­ной, ко­то­рый в свою оче­редь равен тан­ген­су угла на­кло­на дан­ной ка­са­тель­ной к оси абс­цисс. По­стро­им тре­уголь­ник с вер­ши­на­ми в точ­ках  <span data-inline-latex=\"A(-1;2)\"></span> ,  <span data-inline-latex=\"B(-1;3)\"></span> ,  <span data-inline-latex=\"C(4;2)\"></span> . Угол на­кло­на ка­са­тель­ной к оси абс­цисс будет равен углу, смеж­но­му с углом <var data-math-identifier=\"ACB\">ACB</var>:</p><center><p> <span data-inline-latex=\"y'(x_0)=\\tg (180^{\\circ}-\\angle ACB)=-\\tg \\angle ACB=-\\frac{AB}{AC}=-\\frac{1}{5}=-0{,}2\"></span>. </p></center>", "title": "Решение", "asset_keys": ["image_2"]}, "operation": "rewrite", "transformation_target_id": "section:solution:1"}, {"at": "2026-10-02T15:53:02.955350+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "deterministic_svg"}, "operation": "remove", "transformation_target_id": "asset:formula_1"}, {"at": "2026-10-02T15:53:02.955350+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "deterministic_svg"}, "operation": "remove", "transformation_target_id": "asset:formula_2"}, {"at": "2026-10-02T15:53:02.955350+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "deterministic_svg"}, "operation": "remove", "transformation_target_id": "asset:formula_3"}, {"at": "2026-10-02T15:53:02.955350+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "deterministic_svg"}, "operation": "remove", "transformation_target_id": "asset:formula_4"}]}, "normalized_content": {"assets": [{"alt": "", "url": "/assets/57d1bd16-a44d-4a56-b4c9-1c7f0f42948f", "kind": "ordinary_image", "asset_id": "57d1bd16-a44d-4a56-b4c9-1c7f0f42948f", "asset_key": "image_1", "transformation_target_id": "asset:image_1"}, {"alt": "", "url": "/assets/25e214aa-aaec-446c-bb2a-25872ce19932", "kind": "ordinary_image", "asset_id": "25e214aa-aaec-446c-bb2a-25872ce19932", "asset_key": "image_2", "transformation_target_id": "asset:image_2"}], "format": "teacherhelper-normalized", "sections": [{"key": "condition", "html": "<p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"57d1bd16-a44d-4a56-b4c9-1c7f0f42948f\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_1\" src=\"/assets/57d1bd16-a44d-4a56-b4c9-1c7f0f42948f\"/>На ри­сун­ке изоб­ра­же­ны гра­фик функ­ции <i>y</i>  =  <i>f</i>(<i>x</i>) и ка­са­тель­ная к нему в точке с абс­цис­сой <i>x</i><sub>0</sub>. Най­ди­те зна­че­ние про­из­вод­ной функ­ции <i>f</i>(<i>x</i>) в точке <i>x</i><sub>0</sub>.</p>", "title": "Условие", "asset_keys": ["image_1"], "section_id": "condition:1", "transformation_target_id": "section:condition:1"}, {"key": "answer", "html": "<p><span data-effect=\"spaced\">-0,2</span></p>", "title": "Ответ", "asset_keys": [], "section_id": "answer:1", "transformation_target_id": "section:answer:1"}, {"key": "solution", "html": "<p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"25e214aa-aaec-446c-bb2a-25872ce19932\" data-asset-key=\"image_2\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_2\" src=\"/assets/25e214aa-aaec-446c-bb2a-25872ce19932\"/></p><p>Зна­че­ние про­из­вод­ной в точке ка­са­ния равно уг­ло­во­му ко­эф­фи­ци­ен­ту ка­са­тель­ной, ко­то­рый в свою оче­редь равен тан­ген­су угла на­кло­на дан­ной ка­са­тель­ной к оси абс­цисс. По­стро­им тре­уголь­ник с вер­ши­на­ми в точ­ках  <span data-inline-latex=\"A(-1;2)\"></span> ,  <span data-inline-latex=\"B(-1;3)\"></span> ,  <span data-inline-latex=\"C(4;2)\"></span> . Угол на­кло­на ка­са­тель­ной к оси абс­цисс будет равен углу, смеж­но­му с углом <var data-math-identifier=\"ACB\">ACB</var>:</p><center><p> <span data-inline-latex=\"y'(x_0)=\\tg (180^{\\circ}-\\angle ACB)=-\\tg \\angle ACB=-\\frac{AB}{AC}=-\\frac{1}{5}=-0{,}2\"></span>. </p></center>", "title": "Решение", "asset_keys": ["image_2"], "section_id": "solution:1", "transformation_target_id": "section:solution:1"}], "schema_version": 3, "problem_reference_ids": {"prototype_problem_id": null, "group_parent_problem_id": null, "adjacent_group_parent_problem_id": null}}}